{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given two positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710e3e4f18d7c0270ab719a00adc61fa12363b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c8120821a3047bcd4f0fd6b03c045ad4b444a04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A.M.$\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> be their arithmetic mean and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87c23f01b6523b540367d65acf5c0228edd470a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G.M.$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> be their positive geometric mean. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c8120821a3047bcd4f0fd6b03c045ad4b444a04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A.M.$\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87c23f01b6523b540367d65acf5c0228edd470a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G.M.$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> is always less than:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0590abd82fb4409e5b1e088573fc0b0ab98eac23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\dfrac{(b+a)^2}{ab}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\dfrac{(b+a)^2}{8b}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\dfrac{(b-a)^2}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"366\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c0d257c75055ae1824d0da9d21b1ecaf85595aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }\\dfrac{(b-a)^2}{8a}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\dfrac{(b-a)^2}{8b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"231\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The difference between the arithmetic and geometric means is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42e50c3b4011c9d0b702a5c520cac4694d4b69ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{2}-\\sqrt{ab} = \\frac{b - 2\\sqrt{ab} + a}{2} = \\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{b}-\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"359\" height=\"57\" />.\n</p><p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93ab831861da01366aabeebf85bcc0b192b583d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{b}-\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2}{2} = \\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{b}-\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2\\left(\\sqrt{b}+\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2}{2\\left(\\sqrt{b}+\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2} = \\frac{(b-a)^2}{2\\left(\\sqrt{b}+\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -34px\" width=\"472\" height=\"78\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/18850c5a6f67139956c8c1e35094c0a864ecb8ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/7/5c77378685b4a71cfe710ef57cbc867cab2cdf8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{b} + \\sqrt{a} &gt; \\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt{a} = 2\\sqrt{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/653e99df415eed3c8283177128ffb05807ec5305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{2}-\\sqrt{ab} = \\frac{(b-a)^2}{2\\left(\\sqrt{b}+\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2} &lt; \\frac{(b-a)^2}{2\\left(2\\sqrt{a}\\right)^2} = \\boxed{ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{(b-a)^2}{8a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -34px\" width=\"471\" height=\"67\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96cb10d2e364267a42efbf2faff28f713aef60d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840295274d2d0e1250181ee997563e42857f500e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 100000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />.  Then the arithmetic mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c2b7cb2d96d13946c45f7e6f348ac95786b40fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1000+100000}{2} = 50500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"189\" height=\"38\" /> and the geometric mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/bec6c27c4f59c9f60d606903392009a172d135a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{1000 \\cdot 100000} = 10000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"191\" height=\"21\" />, so the difference between the means is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdb09566b9e51d110124275f8ea04033b96b34f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50500-10000=40500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"185\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The quantity in choice (A) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6f545b07ce2b05b8803db3ae77e34b373388aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(100000+1000)^2}{1000 \\cdot 100000} &lt; \\frac{120000^2}{1000 \\cdot 100000} = 144 &lt; 40500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"41\" />, so (A) is incorrect.\n</p><p>The quantity in choice (B) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e88c1e92304ec5c25ff571ead82658f18d2f548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(100000+1000)^2}{8 \\cdot 100000} &lt; \\frac{120000^2}{8 \\cdot 100000} = 18000 &lt; 40500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"385\" height=\"41\" />, so (B) is incorrect.\n</p><p>The quantity in choice (C) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3aeca3cd0da6e094b01d192bf87ff07b2e267e79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(100000-1000)^2}{1000 \\cdot 100000} &lt;  \\frac{100000^2}{1000 \\cdot 100000} = 100 &lt; 40500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"41\" />, so (C) is incorrect.\n</p><p>The quantity in choice (E) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/f/28febf6f285b8fa371194458ce994d9892cafeb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(100000-1000)^2}{8 \\cdot 100000} &lt; \\frac{100000^2}{8 \\cdot 100000} = 12500 &lt; 40500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"385\" height=\"41\" />, so (E) is incorrect.\n</p><p>This leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc0665da79a3e66ae9a6e5d7ccb3ab669c2c79e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{(b-a)^2}{8a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"113\" height=\"52\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" ti